# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate.*.backup
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Variables sensibles — utiliser *.tfvars.example à la place
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# Override files
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Plans Terraform (peuvent contenir des secrets)
*.tfplan
*.plan

# Répertoire de plugins Terraform
.terraform.d/

